# 3. Execution Timeline (Gantt Chart)

The bar at the bottom shows which process runs at each time.

| Time    | Running Process | Reason                          |
| ------- | --------------- | ------------------------------- |
| 0 – 2   | C5              | Higher priority than C6         |
| 2 – 4   | C4              | C4 arrives with higher priority |
| 4 – 8   | C1              | Highest priority arrives        |
| 8 – 24  | C3              | Priority 1 processes continue   |
| 24 – 44 | C2              | Next highest priority           |
| 44 – 64 | C5              | Resume unfinished               |
| 64 – 65 | C5              | Finish                          |
| 65 – 80 | C4              | Resume                          |
| 80 – 90 | C6              | Lowest priority runs last       |

